      <description>Hubble 1.1.9

Hubble 1.1.9: Easier startup and login controls

- Open local Hubble directly from HubDash when its service is unavailable.
- Reconnect automatically after slow or interrupted startup.
- See whether Hubble opens at login and change it with a checkbox.
- Preserve existing login settings and make login launch optional for new installations.</description>
